WEBVTT

01:26.830 --> 01:29.720
[Glory]

01:30.640 --> 01:32.910
[Episode 3]

01:34.759 --> 01:35.640
You're mean!

01:35.759 --> 01:36.759
-You're so harsh!
-Behave yourself.

01:36.759 --> 01:37.640
Let me go!

01:37.640 --> 01:38.170
Let me go!

01:38.170 --> 01:38.840
Don't move.

01:39.200 --> 01:40.759
You cursed wretch!

01:41.430 --> 01:43.890
How many more in my family
do you want to harm?

01:47.840 --> 01:49.020
Shanbao.

01:53.950 --> 01:55.410
You're still helping her?

01:58.120 --> 01:59.350
It's all because of her

01:59.350 --> 02:00.550
that Mother fell ill,

02:00.590 --> 02:01.480
that all the medicines didn't work,

02:01.480 --> 02:02.920
and that she passed away so early.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.560
That idiot who never grows up,

02:04.560 --> 02:06.230
what's the use of keeping her alive?

02:06.230 --> 02:07.150
Wanwan is innocent and pure,

02:07.150 --> 02:08.560
knowing nothing of the world.

02:08.560 --> 02:09.520
Mother gave her life

02:09.520 --> 02:10.590
in exchange for hers.

02:10.590 --> 02:12.450
I won't let you harm her in any way.

02:12.840 --> 02:14.170
Wanwan, don't be afraid.

02:14.170 --> 02:14.890
I'm here.

02:23.360 --> 02:24.240
Silly Wanwan.

02:24.840 --> 02:26.440
Don't believe what she says.

02:26.680 --> 02:27.870
No one in the Rong family hates you

02:27.870 --> 02:28.930
more than she does.

02:29.079 --> 02:31.190
She wishes you dead even in her dreams.

02:31.190 --> 02:32.190
Once you're dead,

02:32.240 --> 02:33.680
the lie becomes the truth.

02:33.680 --> 02:35.360
Rong Yunyin, how dare you!

02:38.030 --> 02:38.560
What?

02:40.200 --> 02:41.860
Is she your only blood sister?

02:42.150 --> 02:42.910
Wasn't I born

02:42.910 --> 02:44.310
of the same mother as you?

02:44.560 --> 02:46.290
We're both your blood sisters,

02:46.430 --> 02:48.230
yet you treat her better than me!

03:02.560 --> 03:03.030
Guards!

03:04.190 --> 03:04.790
Miss Rong.

03:05.710 --> 03:06.190
Search!

03:06.520 --> 03:07.000
Yes.

03:19.430 --> 03:20.560
Lock the courtyard gates.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.020
No one is allowed in or out.

03:22.070 --> 03:23.530
You, go search over there.

03:45.270 --> 03:46.150
Stop hitting me. Stop.

03:46.150 --> 03:47.079
Stop hitting me.

03:47.470 --> 03:48.400
Please spare me, Young Master.

03:48.400 --> 03:49.000
I won't dare do it again.

03:49.000 --> 03:49.730
Who's there?

03:50.079 --> 03:51.560
Have you lost your mind
in front of Miss Rong?

03:51.560 --> 03:53.160
What are you babbling about?

03:58.190 --> 03:58.870
Miss Rong.

03:59.450 --> 04:00.780
What are you doing here?

04:01.240 --> 04:01.710
I...

04:04.250 --> 04:05.650
During the day, I dropped

04:05.870 --> 04:07.530
a wooden bucket in the garden.

04:07.750 --> 04:10.410
Afraid of being beaten
by the steward tomorrow,

04:10.750 --> 04:12.560
I wanted to sneak back and retrieve it

04:12.560 --> 04:14.560
while the household
was busy with the banquet.

04:14.560 --> 04:15.870
But I ran into Mr. Wang,

04:16.269 --> 04:17.730
who beat me without a word.

04:18.000 --> 04:19.680
When I heard all the noise just now,

04:19.680 --> 04:21.160
I thought he had returned.

04:21.670 --> 04:24.280
And I just panicked.

04:28.950 --> 04:30.280
What an insolent thief!

04:30.790 --> 04:32.050
How audacious you are,

04:32.800 --> 04:35.000
to be caught red‑handed
and still dare to lie.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.530
Take him away immediately.

04:36.560 --> 04:38.420
No need to trouble the officials.

04:38.430 --> 04:40.159
Give him thirty strokes first.

04:41.409 --> 04:42.810
I would never dare to lie.

04:42.920 --> 04:43.550
Never!

04:44.210 --> 04:44.650
Right.

04:45.950 --> 04:46.830
This jade pendant,

04:46.830 --> 04:47.830
I tore it from him

04:48.070 --> 04:49.159
in my panic.

05:10.510 --> 05:11.110
Miss Rong.

05:11.510 --> 05:12.870
I've checked, and all the guards

05:12.870 --> 05:13.950
were at their posts.

05:13.950 --> 05:15.070
Among those not on duty,

05:15.070 --> 05:16.360
only this stable boy

05:16.510 --> 05:17.910
stayed alone in the shed.

05:18.040 --> 05:18.720
The rest

05:18.720 --> 05:20.120
can vouch for each other.

05:20.160 --> 05:21.960
They never went to Qilan Garden.

05:22.310 --> 05:23.710
As for Xinfang Pavilion,

05:23.830 --> 05:26.360
during the gathering, Mr. Song, Mr. Lin,

05:26.360 --> 05:29.270
and Mr. Wang all left their seats
at different times,

05:29.270 --> 05:31.270
and their whereabouts are unknown.

05:35.800 --> 05:37.530
Miss Rong, he truly didn't lie.

05:37.760 --> 05:38.460
This wooden bucket

05:38.460 --> 05:40.120
was indeed left in the garden.

05:43.870 --> 05:46.600
It seems someone named Wang
was causing trouble.

05:46.920 --> 05:47.850
What's his name?

05:48.159 --> 05:48.920
Miss Rong.

05:49.360 --> 05:49.960
His name is

05:50.920 --> 05:51.600
Wang...

05:53.070 --> 05:53.830
Wang Lu.

05:54.159 --> 05:54.960
That's right.

05:55.190 --> 05:56.250
His name is Wang Lu.

05:56.790 --> 05:57.600
Wang Lu?

05:58.270 --> 05:59.870
Fire! Fire!

06:00.300 --> 06:02.190
Help! It's on fire!

06:02.190 --> 06:04.190
It's coming from Xinfang Pavilion.

06:18.720 --> 06:21.830
Miss Rong, what else should I do?

06:22.510 --> 06:23.390
Lift your head.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.880
It's such a lively scene.

06:48.650 --> 06:50.110
You should come along too.

07:04.440 --> 07:06.240
Miss Rong, it's my fault

07:06.240 --> 07:08.000
for being negligent with Mr. Wen.

07:08.000 --> 07:08.730
Thankfully,

07:09.040 --> 07:10.430
he wasn't hurt badly.

07:10.430 --> 07:10.890
Miss...

07:12.260 --> 07:12.700
Bao.

07:14.310 --> 07:14.800
Bao.

07:21.680 --> 07:22.190
You...

07:23.480 --> 07:24.480
You'd better escort Mr. Wen

07:24.480 --> 07:25.360
back to his room to rest.

07:25.360 --> 07:25.830
Yes.

07:27.630 --> 07:30.160
Only flawless jade
is worthy of being paired.

07:30.270 --> 07:31.330
He is that useless.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.750
Even ten guards

07:33.120 --> 07:34.630
would fail to keep his virtue intact.

07:34.630 --> 07:35.830
Who set the fire?

07:37.840 --> 07:39.159
I saw Mr. Wen

07:39.159 --> 07:39.950
was drunk

07:40.570 --> 07:41.830
and feared he might fall,

07:41.830 --> 07:43.290
so I quietly followed him.

07:43.510 --> 07:45.390
Then I saw someone sneaking

07:45.390 --> 07:47.040
into his room under cover of night.

07:47.040 --> 07:48.830
I couldn't make a fuss
but couldn't do nothing either,

07:48.830 --> 07:50.630
so I used smoke to drive them off.

07:50.830 --> 07:52.800
I acted out of urgency
and couldn't inform anyone beforehand.

07:52.800 --> 07:54.460
Please forgive me, Miss Rong.

08:02.720 --> 08:05.950
Fire! Fire!

08:08.310 --> 08:09.560
Fire!

08:13.170 --> 08:14.200
Fire!

08:19.730 --> 08:20.330
Miss Rong.

08:20.710 --> 08:22.570
The guests have all been settled.

08:22.840 --> 08:24.720
Luckily, nothing serious happened.

08:24.720 --> 08:25.310
Just

08:25.600 --> 08:28.260
one of Young Master's
brocade robes got burned.

08:28.430 --> 08:29.290
You silly fool.

08:29.830 --> 08:31.750
There are plenty of silk
and cloth in the guest rooms.

08:31.750 --> 08:33.350
Just burn whatever you like.

08:33.669 --> 08:35.330
Why would you burn your own clothes?

08:35.330 --> 08:37.059
You're not so clever yourself.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.360
Perhaps that's exactly

08:38.360 --> 08:39.600
what he wanted you to ask.

08:39.600 --> 08:41.780
None of those things belong to me.

08:46.390 --> 08:47.600
Wen Can is tall

08:47.840 --> 08:49.100
and completely drunk.

08:49.630 --> 08:52.160
A frail woman would
have trouble handling him.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.620
Didn't you see anyone else

08:53.900 --> 08:55.060
when you came?

09:01.160 --> 09:02.820
Forgive me for arriving late.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.240
I didn't see anyone else.

09:08.160 --> 09:10.160
Thanks for your help, Young Master.

09:10.260 --> 09:11.120
Steward Cheng.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.650
Escort him back to his room.

09:14.490 --> 09:15.010
Yes.

09:17.160 --> 09:18.610
Mr. Bai, this way please.

09:23.750 --> 09:24.390
Miss Rong.

09:24.910 --> 09:25.840
After the fire,

09:25.840 --> 09:27.000
everyone was either in their rooms

09:27.000 --> 09:28.200
or in the Flower Hall.

09:28.630 --> 09:30.030
Only Song Yifang,

09:30.150 --> 09:31.600
Lin Shishuo, and Wang Lu

09:31.600 --> 09:32.400
arrived late.

09:32.870 --> 09:34.320
That Wang Lu in particular

09:34.320 --> 09:36.450
was hesitant and unclear in his words.

09:36.600 --> 09:39.240
So they actually went wandering
in the garden at night.

09:39.240 --> 09:41.180
Since we don't know which one it was,

09:41.180 --> 09:42.580
detain all three of them.

09:43.320 --> 09:44.780
Yunyin, watch your words.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.000
Miss Rong.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.730
I have something important to report.

10:03.720 --> 10:04.960
Don't stop me!

10:05.840 --> 10:07.150
Give me two more drinks.

10:07.150 --> 10:08.390
Tell Mr. Bai that

10:08.390 --> 10:09.630
I can drink more.

10:11.510 --> 10:12.570
Alright, alright.

10:12.600 --> 10:13.400
Don't help me.

10:15.270 --> 10:15.790
Wine.

10:16.270 --> 10:17.670
-Young Master. -Let me drink.

10:17.670 --> 10:18.630
I'm here with Young Master.

10:18.630 --> 10:19.430
You may leave.

10:19.550 --> 10:20.960
-Yes. -One more drink.

10:24.270 --> 10:25.070
Young Master.

10:39.240 --> 10:41.000
How many went tonight?

10:42.870 --> 10:43.670
Fifteen.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.510
Still too slow.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.280
More drinks.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.630
Bring me good wine.

10:51.630 --> 10:52.790
-The best one.
-Okay, okay.

10:52.790 --> 10:53.600
More drinks.

11:07.550 --> 11:09.120
Please forgive me, Miss Rong.

11:09.120 --> 11:10.670
I'm the one who accidentally entered

11:10.670 --> 11:11.930
Qilan Garden tonight.

11:13.390 --> 11:15.120
Didn't you already cover it up?

11:20.550 --> 11:22.280
Miss Rong, you're sharp‑eyed.

11:22.600 --> 11:23.730
I might fool others,

11:24.440 --> 11:25.900
but I could never fool you.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.630
What are you trying to do,

11:28.240 --> 11:30.240
sneaking into Qilan Garden at night

11:30.410 --> 11:32.210
to eavesdrop on me and my sister?

11:32.910 --> 11:34.720
After falling from the cliff,

11:35.390 --> 11:36.720
I should have been dead.

11:37.360 --> 11:39.960
It was only by your kindness
that I was taken in,

11:40.150 --> 11:41.630
treated, and kept alive.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.280
I came to Qilan Garden

11:43.480 --> 11:45.790
because there is a matter
of great importance.

11:45.790 --> 11:46.550
Go ahead.

11:48.790 --> 11:50.320
Please wait a moment, Miss.

12:35.920 --> 12:36.710
Indenture?

12:40.870 --> 12:43.330
I trespassed into Qilan Garden
late at night

12:44.080 --> 12:46.210
only because our difference in status

12:46.390 --> 12:48.840
forbade me from
speaking with you privately.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.200
Miss Rong, your grace in saving my life

12:50.200 --> 12:51.260
is beyond measure.

12:52.000 --> 12:53.440
How could it ever be repaid

12:53.440 --> 12:54.480
by merely tending a few horses

12:54.480 --> 12:55.680
or doing menial work?

12:56.270 --> 12:58.150
Miss Rong, if you don't despise me,

12:58.150 --> 12:59.870
I'm willing to be your servant,

12:59.870 --> 13:03.000
and do whatever you command,
serving you for all my days.

13:32.310 --> 13:35.030
From now on, if you bid me live,

13:35.670 --> 13:36.400
I shall live.

13:37.550 --> 13:38.670
If you bid me die,

13:39.440 --> 13:40.150
I shall die.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.450
In life and in death,

13:42.670 --> 13:43.870
I belong to you alone.

13:44.520 --> 13:47.980
Should I ever betray this vow,
may Heaven itself deny me mercy.

13:52.480 --> 13:54.810
You want to be a servant
of the Rong family?

13:55.000 --> 13:56.260
Not the Rong family's.

13:57.400 --> 13:58.400
Yours.

14:08.200 --> 14:09.320
Listen and tell me

14:09.960 --> 14:11.020
whether I am right.

14:12.160 --> 14:14.070
Covered in injuries,

14:15.110 --> 14:17.360
you feared you had made
some enemies outside,

14:17.360 --> 14:19.630
so you dare not leave
the Rong family lightly.

14:19.630 --> 14:20.890
You came to me secretly

14:21.340 --> 14:23.800
because you want
to discover your identity.

14:24.000 --> 14:26.400
After overhearing a few words
between Yunyin and me,

14:26.400 --> 14:28.510
you feared that Yunyin might harm you.

14:28.510 --> 14:30.440
So you intend to use this indenture

14:30.800 --> 14:32.510
to secure a way out through me.

14:33.930 --> 14:34.560
Am I right?

14:35.600 --> 14:37.200
I beg you to see the sincerity

14:37.720 --> 14:38.980
of my heart, Miss Rong.

14:43.150 --> 14:44.840
You're clearly desperate to survive,

14:44.840 --> 14:46.040
with no other choice.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.840
Yet you present yourself
with such honesty and sincerity,

14:47.840 --> 14:49.350
with a clear sense of gratitude and duty.

14:49.350 --> 14:51.740
Having someone of your talent
serving in the Rong family

14:51.740 --> 14:52.940
is quite a gain for me.

14:54.240 --> 14:56.870
Well. Go to Xinfang Pavilion

14:57.600 --> 14:59.200
and take good care of Wen Can.

15:00.000 --> 15:01.330
Miss Rong, your request

15:01.490 --> 15:03.270
is not something I should refuse.

15:03.270 --> 15:05.320
But I'm just a lowly person.

15:05.910 --> 15:07.750
I still live in that shack

15:08.240 --> 15:09.870
and need to tend the horses.

15:10.750 --> 15:12.950
It's hard for me to fulfill both duties.

15:13.460 --> 15:14.750
He's trying all sorts of ways

15:14.750 --> 15:16.150
to get better treatment.

15:16.470 --> 15:17.150
Besides,

15:17.550 --> 15:20.080
Xinfang Pavilion
is full of important guests,

15:20.080 --> 15:21.940
none of whom are easy to deal with.

15:22.000 --> 15:24.400
With my unknown background and low status,

15:25.190 --> 15:26.590
I fear I cannot handle it,

15:27.240 --> 15:28.640
thus failing your trust.

15:30.630 --> 15:32.230
You saw it yourself tonight.

15:32.870 --> 15:34.480
There is constant danger

15:34.480 --> 15:35.680
surrounding Wen Can.

15:36.120 --> 15:37.720
I can't always be by his side.

15:38.630 --> 15:40.740
So I need someone sharp-eyed
and clear-minded

15:40.740 --> 15:42.070
to keep him out of danger

15:42.440 --> 15:43.970
and turn bad luck into good.

15:44.080 --> 15:45.010
After it's done,

15:45.390 --> 15:47.910
I'll have someone
investigate your identity

15:47.910 --> 15:50.480
and send you where you belong.

15:51.720 --> 15:54.480
Do you truly mean it, Miss Rong?

15:56.870 --> 15:59.270
Let's seal our agreement with a handshake.

16:20.500 --> 16:25.660
♪ Who tore a strand of light
from the night ♪

16:25.870 --> 16:26.960
Since you belong to me now,

16:26.620 --> 16:32.910
♪ Hearing the lament of fading beauty ♪

16:27.750 --> 16:29.480
I should give you a name myself.

16:30.070 --> 16:31.070
From today on,

16:31.910 --> 16:34.150
you shall be called Fusheng.

16:33.120 --> 16:39.160
♪ Worldly passions drift away,
turning into twilight ♪

16:36.240 --> 16:38.570
I, Fusheng, thank you, Miss,
for the name.

16:39.370 --> 16:45.410
♪ Grass grows, orioles fly,
long lives fall ♪

16:39.910 --> 16:40.480
But

16:41.320 --> 16:43.380
I should have a surname, shouldn't I?

16:44.320 --> 16:44.980
Let it be Lu.

16:46.090 --> 16:52.000
♪ Love returns in scattered fragments,
yet longing remains ♪

16:46.350 --> 16:48.810
I, Lu Fusheng, thank you,
Miss, for the name.

16:49.030 --> 16:50.030
You may leave now.

16:52.030 --> 16:58.500
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

16:58.930 --> 17:02.280
♪ Flowers bloom and fade,
days rise and nights fall ♪

17:02.310 --> 17:05.480
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

17:05.510 --> 17:12.369
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

17:24.200 --> 17:25.400
Who's lurking there?

17:28.710 --> 17:29.240
Come out!

17:34.440 --> 17:35.240
It's Mr. Song.

17:36.440 --> 17:37.100
Search him.

17:37.110 --> 17:37.550
Yes.

17:52.680 --> 17:55.270
Gilded entwined-branch candlestick
from the Flower Hall.

17:55.270 --> 17:57.350
What a well-bred gentleman you are.

17:58.590 --> 17:59.350
By law,

17:59.650 --> 18:01.590
the thief shall be beaten
eighty times with a rod.

18:01.590 --> 18:02.030
Yes.

18:04.790 --> 18:05.960
Please have mercy, Ms. Yan.

18:05.960 --> 18:07.020
Please have mercy.

18:11.240 --> 18:13.170
Though my family has a noble title,

18:13.550 --> 18:14.480
we are in ruin.

18:16.310 --> 18:17.110
I am…

18:18.790 --> 18:19.960
I am utterly desperate.

18:19.960 --> 18:21.020
That's why I did it.

18:27.200 --> 18:29.090
Please show leniency, Ms. Yan.

18:35.920 --> 18:37.150
With conduct like this,

18:37.150 --> 18:39.280
you've truly sullied your good looks.

18:47.750 --> 18:49.010
Ms. Yan, if you like it,

18:49.920 --> 18:51.300
I can have this candlestick

18:51.300 --> 18:52.740
sent to your room.

19:34.070 --> 19:35.070
If you like it,

19:35.630 --> 19:36.480
I can leave

19:36.480 --> 19:37.810
this candlestick here.

19:46.270 --> 19:48.000
Mr. Song, if you want to learn

19:48.000 --> 19:49.510
how to stand on your own,

19:49.880 --> 19:50.920
I

19:50.920 --> 19:53.240
can teach you some
of the rules in the Rong family,

19:53.240 --> 19:54.840
so you can support yourself.

19:55.640 --> 19:58.370
It is far better than
starving in a fallen family.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.510
As for the noble Miss Rong,

20:00.680 --> 20:02.440
she's out of your reach.

20:03.240 --> 20:04.970
Let go of your hopes from now on.

20:57.870 --> 20:58.980
Your tea-making

20:59.450 --> 21:01.010
has always been flawless.

21:01.880 --> 21:03.610
Yet the matter of your marriage

21:03.960 --> 21:05.310
is always on my mind.

21:05.960 --> 21:08.070
Fifteen people went there yesterday.

21:08.070 --> 21:10.960
Do any of the remaining ones
catch your eye?

21:12.790 --> 21:13.400
No.

21:15.680 --> 21:17.200
If none are to your liking,

21:17.480 --> 21:19.310
dismiss them and continue the search.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.110
Grandmother.

21:20.640 --> 21:21.440
The men who came this time

21:21.440 --> 21:22.680
are all talented from various regions.

21:22.680 --> 21:24.010
There's no need to rush.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.710
From what I can see,

21:26.200 --> 21:27.400
Shanbao still wishes to test

21:27.400 --> 21:28.860
their character further.

21:29.880 --> 21:32.340
As long as you know what to do,
that's enough.

21:45.610 --> 21:47.510
Has anyone from the Yan family arrived?

21:47.510 --> 21:48.960
The age card was sent earlier,

21:48.960 --> 21:51.220
and they are probably still on their way.

21:52.890 --> 21:54.000
Ganlu Temple on Mount Meng

21:54.000 --> 21:55.310
isn't far from here.

21:56.560 --> 21:58.090
Why are they taking so long?

21:58.400 --> 22:00.260
Lady Rong, shall we send someone?

22:00.880 --> 22:01.480
Forget it.

22:02.200 --> 22:03.240
Judging by Bao's attitude,

22:03.240 --> 22:05.300
she won't make a choice anytime soon.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.490
So there's no need to hurry.

22:08.070 --> 22:08.830
Lady Rong.

22:09.510 --> 22:11.160
Yesterday, one of the rejected suitors,

22:11.160 --> 22:12.000
Song Yifang,

22:12.290 --> 22:13.630
coming from a poor family,

22:13.630 --> 22:15.760
is willing to serve in the Rong family.

22:16.200 --> 22:17.510
I find him clever

22:17.990 --> 22:19.320
and somewhat educated.

22:20.200 --> 22:22.000
Would you consider keeping him?

22:23.440 --> 22:26.270
You can handle
such matters as you see fit.

22:26.960 --> 22:27.440
Yes.

22:28.720 --> 22:29.550
Jingyi.

22:30.580 --> 22:32.140
You look

22:32.350 --> 22:34.070
radiant today.

22:36.640 --> 22:38.750
Being able to serve
by your side, Lady Rong,

22:38.750 --> 22:40.160
is a blessing for me.

22:45.440 --> 22:47.270
Grandmother still loves you the most,

22:47.270 --> 22:47.960
and truly wants you

22:47.960 --> 22:49.360
to find someone perfect.

22:54.630 --> 22:55.350
You know,

22:56.680 --> 22:58.940
Grandmother gave me the right to choose,

22:58.960 --> 22:59.750
but she didn't give me

22:59.750 --> 23:01.410
the right not to choose at all.

23:12.870 --> 23:15.040
[Qilan Garden]

23:17.830 --> 23:18.240
Bao.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.330
Call me Shanbao.

23:23.350 --> 23:24.110
Shanbao.

23:24.670 --> 23:26.400
They all forced me to drink last night.

23:26.400 --> 23:27.660
They know you favor me,

23:27.960 --> 23:29.400
so they all want to harm me.

23:29.400 --> 23:30.750
Those men are all petty,

23:30.750 --> 23:31.640
full of schemes,

23:31.640 --> 23:33.300
and definitely not your match.

23:33.300 --> 23:34.980
Could you send them all away?

23:35.620 --> 23:36.100
No.

23:36.440 --> 23:37.270
If they don't leave,

23:37.270 --> 23:38.160
they'll surely gang up

23:38.160 --> 23:38.930
to bully me.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.200
Shanbao.

23:40.400 --> 23:42.030
How can you be so stone-hearted,

23:42.030 --> 23:42.940
so icy,

23:43.240 --> 23:44.240
and so cruel?

23:44.720 --> 23:46.780
Don't you care about me even a little?

23:46.880 --> 23:48.940
If you can't handle it, you can leave.

23:49.110 --> 23:49.720
Shanbao.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.270
This person beside you

23:54.270 --> 23:55.270
is quite capable.

23:55.720 --> 23:56.850
Feel free to use him.

24:06.110 --> 24:07.910
Why did Shanbao just praise you?

24:08.590 --> 24:09.720
Miss Rong means that

24:10.270 --> 24:11.480
if there's any danger,

24:11.480 --> 24:14.140
you can push me forward
to shield you at any time.

24:34.070 --> 24:35.590
Yesterday's banquet was a trap.

24:35.590 --> 24:37.750
Miss Rong has yet to make an appearance.

24:37.750 --> 24:39.600
What? Another trap today?

24:40.400 --> 24:42.130
Mr. He, you're being too harsh.

24:42.170 --> 24:43.440
Miss Rong once said that

24:43.440 --> 24:45.480
integrity is a gentleman's virtue.

24:45.920 --> 24:46.790
All the gentlemen

24:46.790 --> 24:47.680
standing in this hall today

24:47.680 --> 24:48.920
are men of impeccable character

24:48.920 --> 24:49.980
and noble conduct.

24:51.270 --> 24:52.000
If that's the case,

24:52.000 --> 24:53.790
why hasn't Miss Rong shown herself yet?

24:53.790 --> 24:55.400
Don't tell me she intends
to have a servant

24:55.400 --> 24:56.630
evaluate those suitors on her behalf?

24:56.630 --> 24:58.590
Marriage depends on character

24:58.790 --> 24:59.680
as well as fate.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.200
Miss Rong intends

25:01.200 --> 25:03.460
to invite one gentleman to dine with her.

25:03.480 --> 25:04.790
That's why she sent me here today.

25:04.790 --> 25:05.240
Invite whom?

25:05.240 --> 25:06.040
Me, of course.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.720
All gentlemen,

25:11.720 --> 25:13.030
please have a gift ready.

25:13.030 --> 25:13.790
Whoever's gift

25:13.790 --> 25:15.190
catches Miss Rong's eye,

25:15.310 --> 25:17.510
she will host a banquet at Qilan Garden.

25:17.830 --> 25:18.960
You have three days.

25:27.590 --> 25:29.750
Mr. Wen, you and Miss Rong

25:29.750 --> 25:30.750
grew up together.

25:30.790 --> 25:31.920
Do you know what

25:32.220 --> 25:32.830
Miss Rong likes?

25:32.830 --> 25:34.030
Right, tell us!

25:34.030 --> 25:34.720
Tell us.

25:34.720 --> 25:35.270
Tell us.

25:37.070 --> 25:38.470
Shanbao likes sweets.

25:39.190 --> 25:40.240
The sweeter, the better.

25:40.240 --> 25:41.270
Sweets?

25:41.290 --> 25:42.200
-The sweeter, the better.
-I'll buy it now.

25:42.200 --> 25:43.400
The sweeter, the better.

25:43.400 --> 25:44.550
The sweeter, the better.

25:44.550 --> 25:45.440
The sweeter, the better.

25:45.440 --> 25:46.590
The sweeter, the better.

25:46.590 --> 25:47.920
Mr. Wen, tell us more.

25:47.920 --> 25:49.380
What else? Please tell us.

25:49.400 --> 25:50.730
What else does she like?

25:51.400 --> 25:52.800
Can we trust what he says?

25:52.980 --> 25:53.590
Yes.

25:53.880 --> 25:55.110
Seems we can't.

25:57.530 --> 25:58.730
You're quite clever.

25:59.030 --> 26:00.760
Yesterday's alliance is over.

26:01.070 --> 26:02.470
Now that we're on our own.

26:03.790 --> 26:04.400
You...

26:10.080 --> 26:12.930
You're bound to lose.

26:19.240 --> 26:20.240
You poor scholar.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.680
Our Rong family has everything.

26:41.680 --> 26:42.440
Yet she

26:42.830 --> 26:44.760
comes right away asking for gifts.

26:45.740 --> 26:46.350
People who don't know better

26:46.350 --> 26:47.240
might think our Rong family

26:47.240 --> 26:48.700
is full of shallow people.

26:49.530 --> 26:50.880
When you're eating at my place,

26:50.880 --> 26:52.970
don't talk about such unpleasant things,

26:52.970 --> 26:54.500
or you'll get indigestion.

26:54.720 --> 26:55.310
Yunxi.

26:55.790 --> 26:56.790
Have you read those age cards

26:56.790 --> 26:57.900
I gave you last time?

26:57.900 --> 26:58.680
Even if you marry

26:58.680 --> 27:00.040
later than Rong Shanbao,

27:00.040 --> 27:00.880
you can't fall behind her

27:00.880 --> 27:02.680
when it comes to bearing an heir.

27:06.640 --> 27:08.640
All I care about is cultivating tea.

27:09.000 --> 27:11.260
I don't really care about these matters.

27:13.440 --> 27:14.350
Indeed.

27:14.960 --> 27:16.890
Those men all seem quite ordinary.

27:22.160 --> 27:23.640
But there is a silly one.

27:48.750 --> 27:49.610
Mr. Bai, you...

27:51.480 --> 27:52.740
Don't disturb others.

28:05.880 --> 28:07.470
He really is a silly one.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.920
I know my sister's preferences

28:25.920 --> 28:27.070
very well.

28:27.750 --> 28:29.310
But in this world,

28:29.310 --> 28:30.640
nothing comes for free.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.590
Mr. Rong, just tell us,

28:33.110 --> 28:35.920
what we can do for you.

28:36.680 --> 28:39.010
Basic information costs one tael of gold.

28:39.240 --> 28:41.440
Decent information, ten taels.

28:41.920 --> 28:43.650
As for top-grade information,

28:43.750 --> 28:45.400
fifty taels.

28:45.830 --> 28:48.830
Cash on delivery, fair and square.

29:01.830 --> 29:02.630
Young Master.

29:02.930 --> 29:04.000
Miss Rong requests that you

29:04.000 --> 29:06.270
continue kneeling
outside the ancestral hall.

29:06.270 --> 29:07.030
Why?

29:07.360 --> 29:08.420
Miss Rong said that

29:08.880 --> 29:10.490
if you can sell out

29:10.510 --> 29:12.370
her preferences for money today,

29:12.550 --> 29:13.160
tomorrow

29:13.270 --> 29:15.310
you could sell out
the Rong family for money.

29:15.310 --> 29:16.200
That's why you must be punished.

29:16.200 --> 29:16.920
Nonsense!

29:17.620 --> 29:18.590
Am I the kind of person

29:18.590 --> 29:20.110
who can't tell right from wrong?

29:20.110 --> 29:20.680
Besides,

29:21.110 --> 29:23.040
I haven't even taken the money yet!

29:23.740 --> 29:25.540
You... what are you doing? What?

29:25.830 --> 29:27.550
I... let me go! Let me go!

29:27.720 --> 29:28.790
Let go of me!

29:29.240 --> 29:30.700
-What are you doing?
-Gentlemen.

29:30.700 --> 29:31.160
I...

29:31.400 --> 29:32.350
Don't waste your time

29:32.350 --> 29:34.270
trying to know Miss Rong's tastes.

29:34.270 --> 29:36.030
You'd be better off using that time

29:36.030 --> 29:39.030
to prepare a proper gift.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.440
Yes.

29:42.720 --> 29:43.920
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

29:51.030 --> 29:52.360
What happened, Mr. Wen?

29:53.710 --> 29:55.510
They're all wrong.

29:56.110 --> 29:56.750
What?

29:57.200 --> 29:59.000
Shanbao doesn't like anything.

29:59.590 --> 30:01.050
Ever since she was little,

30:01.110 --> 30:03.270
she's been like a bodhisattva in a temple,

30:03.270 --> 30:05.000
showing no preferences at all.

30:13.550 --> 30:15.350
Shanbao only needs to choose me,

30:16.000 --> 30:16.790
yet suddenly there are

30:16.790 --> 30:18.320
so many meddlesome people.

30:18.790 --> 30:19.350
Why do they think

30:19.350 --> 30:20.750
they can dine in her room?

30:23.880 --> 30:25.540
Mr. Wen, don't worry too much.

30:25.750 --> 30:27.590
You and Miss Rong grew up together.

30:27.590 --> 30:28.720
No one else can match

30:28.790 --> 30:30.190
that kind of connection.

30:35.160 --> 30:36.030
No wonder Shanbao said that

30:36.030 --> 30:37.230
you're a capable man.

30:37.310 --> 30:39.240
You have reminded me.

30:49.070 --> 30:51.920
Miss Rong, something's happened
at the tea shop.

30:57.940 --> 30:59.380
[Second-grade goods of the Rong Family]

30:58.670 --> 30:59.270
Everyone.

30:59.400 --> 31:00.990
[Rong's Tea House]

30:59.580 --> 31:00.790
I paid 3,000 taels of silver

31:00.790 --> 31:02.790
for premium Mingqian Longjing Tea.

31:02.830 --> 31:04.690
But when it arrived in Guangzhou,

31:04.960 --> 31:06.110
I found it mixed with

31:06.110 --> 31:07.270
dyed inferior tea!

31:07.550 --> 31:08.680
That's impossible.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.310
Look, everyone.

31:10.310 --> 31:12.550
The tea's all cloudy.

31:13.030 --> 31:15.830
The Rong's Tea House is full of swindlers!

31:17.510 --> 31:18.640
Swindlers?

31:18.880 --> 31:19.510
That can't be right.

31:19.510 --> 31:20.160
Make way.

31:22.040 --> 31:22.610
Make way!

31:24.640 --> 31:25.880
Miss Rong is here.

31:25.880 --> 31:26.880
Miss Rong is here.

31:35.110 --> 31:35.590
Miss Rong.

31:35.590 --> 31:36.240
Miss Rong.

31:38.440 --> 31:39.500
Where's the goods?

31:40.310 --> 31:42.350
I haven't even touched the seals yet.

31:42.350 --> 31:43.030
Miss Rong,

31:43.680 --> 31:45.540
you have to take responsibility.

31:49.860 --> 31:50.490
Scissors.

32:18.680 --> 32:19.810
What does this mean?

32:19.950 --> 32:20.910
It looks like...

32:21.640 --> 32:22.270
Mr. Liu.

32:23.030 --> 32:23.920
Miss Rong.

32:24.150 --> 32:25.550
I bought a new batch of tea

32:25.590 --> 32:27.070
that hasn't been shipped yet.

32:27.070 --> 32:27.790
Bring it here.

32:27.790 --> 32:28.340
Yes.

32:37.890 --> 32:38.720
Look.

32:43.690 --> 32:44.490
Let's wait.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.960
How did this character appear?

32:57.960 --> 32:58.720
It's a mark.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.580
There is a character underneath.

33:01.310 --> 33:02.350
The Rong family has always done business

33:02.350 --> 33:03.920
honestly and fairly.

33:04.590 --> 33:05.310
Mr. Wang.

33:05.750 --> 33:07.280
What else do you have to say?

33:09.720 --> 33:10.960
You can't leave! You can't leave!

33:10.960 --> 33:11.550
Move aside!

33:11.550 --> 33:12.510
You can't leave!

33:13.200 --> 33:14.530
What kind of tea is this?

33:14.790 --> 33:16.050
I'll beat you to death!

33:18.200 --> 33:19.110
How dare you slander Miss Rong!

33:19.110 --> 33:21.310
You must give Miss Rong an explanation!

33:22.880 --> 33:24.310
She didn't even say much,

33:24.720 --> 33:26.110
and it was all settled.

33:27.790 --> 33:30.070
The Rong family's centuries-old reputation

33:30.070 --> 33:31.530
truly lives up to its name.

33:33.270 --> 33:37.000
Miss Rong

33:38.240 --> 33:39.350
really stands out.

33:42.720 --> 33:44.520
The Rong family has gone too far.

33:45.000 --> 33:46.270
You know what to do.

33:46.640 --> 33:47.110
Yes.

34:33.170 --> 34:33.840
Miss Rong!

34:34.530 --> 34:35.190
Miss Rong!

34:37.590 --> 34:38.280
Miss Rong.

34:39.210 --> 34:41.469
Mr. Wen has been struck with severe pain,

34:41.510 --> 34:43.310
sweating through three layers of clothes.

34:43.310 --> 34:44.590
Yet he refuses to call for a physician

34:44.590 --> 34:46.050
and insists on seeing you.

34:46.920 --> 34:47.980
Please, Miss Rong,

34:48.199 --> 34:49.260
go check on him now.

35:31.230 --> 35:31.760
Shanbao.

35:32.760 --> 35:33.890
After much thought,

35:34.510 --> 35:35.340
I still don't know

35:35.340 --> 35:36.400
what gift I should

35:36.400 --> 35:36.930
give you.

35:37.820 --> 35:40.260
In the past, we grew up together

35:40.590 --> 35:41.790
with deep affection.

35:42.070 --> 35:42.600
Shanbao.

35:43.550 --> 35:44.880
You're my older cousin,

35:45.320 --> 35:47.710
but please don't always see me
as just a little brother.

35:47.710 --> 35:48.670
Time has passed,

35:49.150 --> 35:50.940
and I've grown into a man now.

35:51.400 --> 35:53.660
I'm willing to conquer the world for you,

35:54.360 --> 35:55.400
and protect you

35:56.220 --> 35:58.410
for all eternity.

36:01.590 --> 36:02.650
What are you doing?

36:02.960 --> 36:03.710
Let me out!

36:04.190 --> 36:05.800
Shanbao, let me out!

36:06.030 --> 36:07.480
Shanbao, let me out!

36:07.710 --> 36:08.400
Let me out!

36:08.440 --> 36:09.500
Miss Rong said that

36:09.880 --> 36:11.280
you can only come out

36:11.280 --> 36:13.680
when you have recovered from your madness.

36:14.070 --> 36:14.920
Shanbao!

36:15.370 --> 36:17.090
Shanbao, let me out!

36:17.540 --> 36:19.000
I'm not being ridiculous.

36:20.070 --> 36:21.460
I'm serious.

36:26.240 --> 36:26.840
Miss Rong.

36:27.380 --> 36:28.320
The Young Master's gift

36:28.320 --> 36:29.240
has been prepared.

36:29.240 --> 36:30.300
Please have a look.

36:30.960 --> 36:31.560
Miss Rong.

36:32.030 --> 36:33.430
Tonight is truly lively.

36:53.230 --> 36:54.030
Do you like it?

36:54.920 --> 36:56.250
Miss Rong, please stay.

36:57.850 --> 36:58.690
Just look.

37:14.710 --> 37:16.880
Men in this world are often unfaithful,

37:16.880 --> 37:18.440
only gold is steadfast.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.740
If I ever betray you in the future,

37:20.740 --> 37:23.000
I will voluntarily leave
this household empty-handed,

37:23.000 --> 37:24.790
leaving this mountain of gold for you

37:24.790 --> 37:26.140
to use for daily needs.

37:26.710 --> 37:28.230
Those suitors outside

37:28.230 --> 37:30.090
only covet your vast tea plantations.

37:30.090 --> 37:32.580
They make empty promises, hoping
to gain much by investing little.

37:32.580 --> 37:33.310
Only I

37:33.930 --> 37:35.590
dare to transform half my business empire

37:35.590 --> 37:36.920
into a mountain of gold,

37:37.230 --> 37:38.390
as a gift of my heart,

37:39.800 --> 37:42.230
just to earn a place by your side.

37:44.090 --> 37:45.220
Put your clothes on.

37:48.440 --> 37:49.440
You don't like it?

37:59.830 --> 38:00.690
I'd rather have

38:01.510 --> 38:02.440
the freshly picked

38:02.440 --> 38:04.300
imperial green buds from Xishan.

38:15.640 --> 38:16.860
[Rong Mansion]

38:19.360 --> 38:20.880
What's going on with this weather?

38:20.880 --> 38:21.840
Why is it so hot?

38:36.020 --> 38:38.480
Mr. Wen, where's your gift?

38:39.400 --> 38:40.190
Mind your own business.

38:40.190 --> 38:41.090
They are all mundane things.

38:41.090 --> 38:41.900
My gift

38:42.360 --> 38:44.290
has already been given to Shanbao.

38:45.960 --> 38:47.290
What have you prepared?

38:47.800 --> 38:48.400
Let me show you.

38:48.400 --> 38:48.840
Don't tell anyone else.

38:48.840 --> 38:50.190
Miss Rong has arrived!

38:50.190 --> 38:50.850
She's here.

39:24.330 --> 39:25.120
Who's first?

39:27.030 --> 39:28.150
I'll go first.

39:28.150 --> 39:28.950
I'll go first.

39:29.110 --> 39:29.920
Miss Rong.

39:30.030 --> 39:31.630
This is my family's heirloom
gold ornament.

39:31.630 --> 39:32.070
It has now been passed down

39:32.070 --> 39:33.320
to the fifth generation with me.

39:33.320 --> 39:34.320
What do you think?

39:39.030 --> 39:39.830
Send him away.

39:40.000 --> 39:40.510
Why?

39:41.030 --> 39:42.000
Even if you don't like it,

39:42.000 --> 39:43.280
you can't just send people away.

39:43.280 --> 39:45.340
This headdress comes from Ruifuxuan

39:45.360 --> 39:47.290
and is worth 1,200 taels of silver.

39:47.460 --> 39:48.320
Am I right?

39:49.820 --> 39:50.380
Guards.

39:51.170 --> 39:51.970
Send him away.

39:56.630 --> 39:58.630
Merchants value honesty above all.

39:59.110 --> 40:00.800
You may choose not to give anything,

40:00.800 --> 40:02.460
but you must not be deceitful.

40:02.840 --> 40:05.970
Our Rong family does not
tolerate unscrupulous people.

40:07.190 --> 40:10.120
These hairpins and jade ornaments
are common items.

40:10.290 --> 40:11.890
Miss Rong, please take a look

40:12.190 --> 40:13.440
at my tea set.

40:17.450 --> 40:18.760
This set consists of
black-gold glazed cups

40:18.760 --> 40:21.070
from the imperial court
of the early Song dynasty.

40:21.070 --> 40:23.000
It's priceless in today's market.

40:24.070 --> 40:25.550
I have painstakingly

40:26.110 --> 40:27.310
sought it out for you.

40:27.770 --> 40:28.370
This time,

40:29.590 --> 40:31.790
you'll definitely like my gift, right?

40:32.050 --> 40:33.110
Indeed, it's nice.

40:38.420 --> 40:39.020
You may go.

41:12.110 --> 41:14.510
Miss Rong, look at this whip.

41:15.160 --> 41:15.810
How is it?

41:18.280 --> 41:18.920
Not bad.

41:23.380 --> 41:25.070
Young Master, please.

41:42.350 --> 41:44.110
Miss Rong, please look at mine.

41:48.240 --> 41:50.060
Young Master, you may leave.

42:17.230 --> 42:17.960
What's this?

42:21.240 --> 42:23.100
This is a copy of The Classic of Tea

42:23.250 --> 42:25.580
that I personally transcribed and bound.

42:37.760 --> 42:39.220
Your handwriting is good.

42:44.400 --> 42:45.710
I... I used to

42:45.710 --> 42:47.840
often help the headmaster copy books.

43:03.890 --> 43:05.480
I've seen all your gifts.

43:06.180 --> 43:07.800
Please take them back with you.

43:07.800 --> 43:08.280
What?

43:09.190 --> 43:11.360
Miss Rong, are these gifts
not to your liking?

43:11.360 --> 43:13.180
When I asked you to prepare gifts,

43:13.180 --> 43:15.040
I wasn't after your possessions.

43:15.550 --> 43:17.350
Gifts carry no measure of worth.

43:17.630 --> 43:19.710
They are entirely
a reflection of your hearts.

43:19.710 --> 43:21.240
The gifts you've presented

43:21.750 --> 43:22.540
reflect

43:22.980 --> 43:24.460
how much you value me.

43:25.480 --> 43:27.320
Now I know completely.

43:28.110 --> 43:30.240
So there is no need to accept the gifts.

43:30.550 --> 43:31.440
Our Rong family won't

43:31.440 --> 43:33.240
let your efforts go unrewarded.

43:34.190 --> 43:36.590
This afternoon, I'll have someone deliver

43:36.820 --> 43:38.420
return gifts of equal value.

43:39.100 --> 43:41.100
Then who will you dine with tonight?

43:41.960 --> 43:44.080
Before dinner, I'll have the steward

43:44.430 --> 43:46.430
personally extend the invitation.

43:59.390 --> 44:01.030
You, come with me.

44:01.820 --> 44:02.260
Yes.

46:35.010 --> 46:37.190
[The Classic of Tea]

46:38.480 --> 46:40.340
This is a copy of The Classic of Tea

46:40.400 --> 46:42.730
that I personally transcribed and bound.

46:44.320 --> 46:45.920
The Classic of Tea is the earliest,

46:45.920 --> 46:47.670
most complete, and most comprehensive

46:47.670 --> 46:48.630
monograph on tea in China

46:48.630 --> 46:50.480
and indeed the world.

46:50.840 --> 46:53.280
It consists of
three volumes and ten chapters,

46:53.280 --> 46:55.880
earning the reputation
of an encyclopedia of tea.

46:55.880 --> 46:58.030
From cultivation methods
and the selection of utensils

46:58.030 --> 47:00.710
to the techniques of brewing tea,
all are meticulously recorded,

47:00.710 --> 47:02.000
making it

47:02.280 --> 47:03.590
an ancient guide for tea.

47:03.590 --> 47:04.840
The author, Lu Yu,

47:04.840 --> 47:06.150
even carefully designed a set of

47:06.150 --> 47:07.550
specialized tea wares

47:07.550 --> 47:08.920
for brewing and drinking tea.

47:08.920 --> 47:10.280
The Classic of Tea is

47:10.280 --> 47:11.510
an important document for studying

47:11.510 --> 47:12.670
ancient Chinese tea culture.

47:12.670 --> 47:14.800
It has promoted the popularity
of tea ceremonies,

47:14.800 --> 47:17.440
and is one of the world's
three greatest tea classics.
